  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic search phases exclude git enumeration; realCold covers git enumeration in the 10k-file, 401-branch fixture.",
    "100k cold index construction is slower overall (222.77ms to 286.24ms) while yielding to unrelated requests.",
    "HTTP load results measure the selected services behind a lightweight server, not the complete production backend, paired SSH transport or WAN latency.",
    "Short-run RSS and zero resources after disconnect do not prove long-run memory stability. A production soak and paired-device cold/warm transfer profile remain necessary.",
    "An OS filesystem syscall already issued cannot be cancelled in Node; I/O stays in its bounded slot until the OS returns. Browser deadlines settle callers, and new requests cannot bypass the queue bound.",
    "Precompressed assets are generated during runtime staging; a development install without generated .br/.gz files serves raw assets."
  ],
